th_pulse", "name_zh": "瘟疫法师·死亡脉冲", "name_en": "Death Pulse", "description_zh": "瘟疫法师向他的周围释放死亡波纹，伤害敌方单位并治疗友军单位。", "description_en": "Necrophos releases a wave of death around him, dealing damage to enemy units and healing allied units.", "notes_zh": ["死亡脉冲不能被躲避。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["area_of_effect", "heal", "projectile_speed", "AbilityDamage", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "healing", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "necrolyte_ghost_shroud", "name_zh": "瘟疫法师·幽魂护罩", "name_en": "Ghost Shroud", "description_zh": "瘟疫法师步入将生者与死者相隔的领域。散发出一片灵气，减缓周围敌人的移动速度。在这个形态下，瘟疫法师为虚无状态，无法攻击或被攻击，受到的魔法伤害增加，但是生命/魔法恢复效果加强。", "description_en": "Necrophos slips into the realm that separates the living from the dead. Unable to attack or be attacked, he emits an aura that slows enemies around him. He takes additional magic damage in this form, but his restorative powers are amplified.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "heal_bonus", "movement_speed", "slow_aoe", "bonus_damage", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aura", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "ethereal", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "magic_resist_reduction", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "necrolyte_heartstopper_aura", "name_zh": "瘟疫法师·竭心光环", "name_en": "Heartstopper Aura", "description_zh": "瘟疫法师让敌人的心脏停跳，使附近敌方单位按最大生命值一定百分比持续流失生命。", "description_en": "Necrophos stills the hearts of his opponents, causing nearby enemy units to lose a percentage of their max health over time.", "notes_zh": ["伤害不会禁用像闪烁匕首等物品。", "不能作用于远古生物。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "竭心光环的生命流失伤害提升，数值为瘟疫法师当前生命恢复的%heal_regen_to_damage%%%。", "en": "Heartstopper Aura's Health Decay is increased by %heal_regen_to_damage%%% of Necrophos's current health regeneration."}}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["aura_radius", "aura_damage", "heal_reduction_pct", "heal_regen_to_damage"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aura", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "mobility_lock", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "necrolyte_death_seeker", "name_zh": "瘟疫法师·死亡搜寻", "name_en": "Death Seeker", "description_zh": "瘟疫法师变成一个大死亡脉冲，向目标单位的地点移动。到达该地点后，死亡脉冲会扩散至附近敌人和友军。", "description_en": "Necrophos turns into a large Death Pulse towards the target unit's position. Once it arrives to the location, the Death Pulse spreads towards nearby enemies and allies.", "notes_zh": ["不会触发法术反弹。"], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["projectile_multiplier", "ethereal_duration", "magic_resistance_reduction", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "spell_reflect", "condition": "shard"}]}, {"subject": "necrolyte_reapers_scythe", "name_zh": "瘟疫法师·死神镰刀", "name_en": "Reaper's Scythe", "description_zh": "眩晕目标敌方英雄，然后造成基于他当前损失生命值的伤害。瘟疫法师击杀敌人后将永久获得生命和魔法恢复。如果目标在死神镰刀效果下死亡，击杀者为瘟疫法师。", "description_en": "Stuns the target enemy hero, then deals damage based on how much life it is missing. If Necrophos kills an enemy this way, he'll permanently gain Health and Mana Regen. Any kill under this effect is credited to Necrophos.", "notes_zh": ["伤害在眩晕结束后结算。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage_per_health", "stun_duration", "hp_per_kill", "mana_per_kill", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "mana_gain", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "stun", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "warlock_fatal_bonds", "name_zh": "术士·致命连接", "name_en": "Fatal Bonds", "description_zh": "将数个可见的敌方单位连接在一起，其中一人所受伤害的一定百分比会被其他所有人感受到。", "description_en": "Binds several visible enemy units together, causing a percentage of the damage dealt to one of them to be felt by the others.", "notes_zh": ["共享伤害的类型与原伤害相同。", "这个技能造成的伤害被视为反弹伤害。反弹伤害不提供任何吸血，而且无法反弹。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["count", "damage_share_percentage", "duration", "search_aoe", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "spell_reflect", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "warlock_shadow_word", "name_zh": "术士·暗言术", "name_en": "Shadow Word", "description_zh": "术士低声说出一个咒语，对一个单位施展法术，使周围的敌方单位受到伤害，周围的友方单位被治疗。目标单位也会被治疗或受到伤害，取决于他是友军还是敌人。", "description_en": "Warlock whispers an incantation, casting a spell on a unit that makes it deal damage to nearby enemy units and heal nearby ally units. Target Unit will also heal or be damaged depending on whether they are ally or enemy.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "duration", "tick_interval", "spell_aoe", "shard_movement_speed_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "healing", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "warlock_upheaval", "name_zh": "术士·剧变", "name_en": "Upheaval", "description_zh": "持续施法 - 随施法时间增强的减速气流，还会造成伤害。持续最多%abilitychanneltime%秒。在魔法结束或目标离开生效区域后，敌人仍会被减速%duration%秒。", "description_en": "CHANNELED - A powerful slowing and damaging current that grows stronger as it's channeled. Lasts up to %abilitychanneltime% seconds. Enemies are slowed for %duration% second after leaving the area or the spell ends.", "notes_zh": ["减速效果的增加是根据持续施法的时长，而不是敌人在区内停留的持续时间。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "持续施法时每%imps_interval%秒术士会召唤一个魔童，持续%minor_imp_duration%秒，魔童死亡时会爆炸，对周围所有敌人造成伤害。", "en": "While channeling, Warlock spawns a minor imp every %imps_interval% seconds that lasts for %minor_imp_duration% seconds and explodes dealing damage to all enemies around them upon death."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["aoe", "slow_per_second", "duration", "max_slow", "aspd_per_second", "base_damage", "damage_per_second", "max_damage", "damage_tick_interval", "imps_interval", "minor_imp_duration", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityChannelTime", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "shard"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "warlock_eldritch_summoning", "name_zh": "术士·邪术召唤", "name_en": "Eldritch Summoning", "description_zh": "只要敌方单位在受到一个或多个术士的技能作用下阵亡，就会召唤出一个魔童，持续%minor_imp_duration%秒，死亡时会爆炸。魔童会自动搜寻附近单位，优先选择致命连接下的英雄，到达猎物时就会爆炸。", "description_en": "Whenever an enemy unit dies while afflicted by one or more of Warlock's abilities, a minor imp is summoned that lasts for %minor_imp_duration% seconds and explodes on death. Imps will automatically seek out nearby units, favoring fatally bonded heroes, and will explode when reaching their prey.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "提升小魔童的生命值和爆炸伤害。", "en": "Increases the health and explosion damage of minor imps."}}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["minor_imp_duration", "imp_health", "imp_explode", "imp_speed", "tooltip_imp_explode_radius"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "summons", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "warlock_rain_of_chaos", "name_zh": "术士·混乱之祭", "name_en": "Chaotic Offering", "description_zh": "从深渊召唤一个地狱火，眩晕敌人%stun_duration%秒。地狱火持续%golem_duration%秒，能够减免部分技能的伤害，具有较高的减速抗性，拥有永久献祭和烈焰之拳技能。", "description_en": "Summons a Golem from the depths, stunning enemies for %stun_duration% seconds. The Golem lives %golem_duration% seconds, takes reduced damage from spells, has increased Slow Resistance, has Permanent Immolation and Flaming Fists on attack.", "notes_zh": ["该技能将摧毁作用范围内的树木。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "召唤%number_of_golems_scepter%个地狱火。", "en": "Calls %number_of_golems_scepter% Golems."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["golem_duration", "stun_duration", "aoe", "golem_hp", "golem_dmg", "golem_armor", "golem_movement_speed", "golem_health_regen", "golem_gold_bounty", "stun_delay", "number_of_golems_scepter", "golem_hp_scepter", "golem_dmg_scepter", "golem_gold_bounty_scepter", "bonus_armor"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "slow_resistance", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "stun", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "summons", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "tree_destroy", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "beastmaster_wild_axes", "name_zh": "兽王·野性之斧", "name_en": "Wild Axes", "description_zh": "兽王投出他的斧头然后召回它们，切开飞过的敌人和树木。每把飞斧对同一个敌人只能击中一次，并且加深来自兽王和其单位的伤害。", "description_en": "Beastmaster sends his axes flying and calls them home again, slicing through enemy units and trees along their path.  Each axe can hit an enemy once, and amplifies subsequent damage from Beastmaster and his units.", "notes_zh": ["此技能将摧毁树木。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "兽王对敌方英雄的攻击还会施加相应等级的野性之斧负面状态。", "en": "Beastmaster's attacks on enemy heroes also apply the Wild Axes debuff of its corresponding level."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "spread", "range", "axe_damage", "duration", "damage_amp", "min_throw_duration", "max_throw_duration", "apply_debuff_on_attack", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "flying", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "tree_destroy", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "beastmaster_summon_razorback", "name_zh": "兽王·召唤刀背兽", "name_en": "Summon Razorback", "description_zh": "兽王召唤一头豪猪前来助阵。豪猪拥有被动的毒素攻击，可以减缓攻击和移动速度。", "description_en": "Beastmaster calls forth a Boar to aid in the battlefield. The Boar has a passive poison attack that slows attack and movement speeds.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "boar_base_max_health", "boar_base_damage", "boar_total_damage_tooltip", "boar_bonus_damage", "boar_base_xp_bounty", "boar_base_movespeed", "boar_moveslow_tooltip", "boar_poison_duration_tooltip", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "beastmaster_summon_raptor", "name_zh": "兽王·召唤猛禽", "name_en": "Summon Raptors", "description_zh": "兽王召唤%hawk_count%只战鹰环绕在他周围，战鹰以%hawk_base_attack_interval%秒的基础攻击间隔俯冲攻击敌人，造成伤害并缠绕。战鹰提升攻击速度后会提升攻击频率。以英雄优先。", "description_en": "Beastmaster summons %hawk_count% hawks that circle around Beastmaster and dive-bombs at enemies with a base attack rate of every %hawk_base_attack_interval%s, damaging and rooting them. Attack rate increases with the Hawk's attack speed. Prioritizes heroes.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "hawk_spawn_interval", "hawk_base_max_health", "hawk_base_gold_bounty", "hawk_base_vision_range", "hawk_base_xp_bounty", "hawk_base_magic_resist", "attack_radius", "hawk_count", "dive_damage", "dive_root_duration", "roaming_radius", "roaming_seconds_per_rotation", "hawk_base_attack_interval", "min_move_speed"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "root", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "beastmaster_drums_of_slom", "name_zh": "兽王·斯洛姆战鼓", "name_en": "Drums of Slom", "description_zh": "兽王或周围他控制的单位攻击敌人都会使他敲下战鼓，对附近单位造成伤害，并且治疗自身和他控制的单位，数值为造成伤害的一定百分比。每次攻击都会降低敲鼓的间隔，%max_stacks%次攻击后降低至最短%min_drum_hit_interval%秒敲击一次。如果没有发动攻击，敲鼓间隔会逐渐变长。使用原始咆哮时自动增加%primal_roar_stacks%层敲鼓叠加效果。", "description_en": "Attacks from Beastmaster or a nearby unit he controls will cause him bang his drum, dealing damage to nearby units and healing Beastmaster and units under his control for a portion of the damage dealt. Every attack decreases the interval between drum hits down to a minimum of %min_drum_hit_interval%s between hits after %max_stacks% attacks. If no attacks are made, the intervals gradually increase.Using Primal Roar counts as %primal_roar_stacks% attacks.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "scepter", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["radius", "max_stacks", "stack_decay_time", "min_drum_hit_interval", "max_drum_hit_interval", "base_damage", "heal_pct", "creep_damage_pct", "creep_heal_pct", "aura_radius", "primal_roar_stacks"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "scepter"}, {"mechanism": "healing", "condition": "scepter"}]}, {"subject": "beastmaster_primal_roar", "name_zh": "兽王·原始咆哮", "name_en": "Primal Roar", "description_zh": "兽王发出震耳欲聋的咆哮，使目标敌方单位受到伤害并眩晕，同时在兽王和他的猎物之间清出一条通道。通道上的所有单位都被震开，也受到伤害并被降低移动和攻击速度。另外，兽王和他的单位获得%movement_speed%%%移动速度提升，持续%movement_speed_duration%秒。", "description_en": "Beastmaster lets loose a deafening roar that stuns, and shoves open a path to its target. All units in the path of the roar are damaged, while units shoved aside by the roar have their movement and attack speed slowed. Additionally, Beastmaster and his units gain %movement_speed%%% movement speed for %movement_speed_duration% seconds.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "damage", "side_damage", "damage_radius", "slow_movement_speed_pct", "slow_attack_speed_pct", "push_distance", "push_duration", "slow_duration", "movement_speed", "movement_speed_duration", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "stun", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "queenofpain_shadow_strike", "name_zh": "痛苦女王·暗影突袭", "name_en": "Shadow Strike", "description_zh": "投出一把淬毒匕首，造成大量初始伤害，并持续造成后续伤害。中毒的单位移动速度被减缓，持续%duration%秒。每%damage_interval%秒会再造成一次伤害。", "description_en": "Hurls a poisoned dagger which deals large initial damage, and then deals damage over time. The poisoned unit has its movement speed slowed for %duration% seconds.  An instance of damage is dealt every %damage_interval% seconds.", "notes_zh": ["受到作用的单位在持续时间内将逐秒缓慢地恢复至初始移动速度。", "受到暗影突袭作用的单位在生命值低于最大值25%时可以被队友反补。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "暗影突袭变为%aoe_radius%范围型技能。暗影突袭效果结束后或重新施加给敌方英雄时，目标将放出痛苦尖叫，伤害附近所有敌人。", "en": "Causes Shadow Strike to become a %aoe_radius% AoE Spell. When Shadow Strike ends or is re-applied to an enemy Hero, the target emits a Scream of Pain, hitting any nearby enemies."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["strike_damage", "duration_damage", "movement_slow", "projectile_speed", "attack_speed", "damage_interval", "generate_scream", "aoe_radius", "duration", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "scepter"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "queenofpain_blink", "name_zh": "痛苦女王·闪烁", "name_en": "Blink", "description_zh": "短距离传送，能让痛苦女王自由出入战场。", "description_en": "Short distance teleportation that allows Queen of Pain to move in and out of combat.", "notes_zh": ["闪烁可以躲避多种飞行过程中的攻击和技能弹道。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "在痛苦女王的闪烁起点和落地点各释放一次音爆。在%shard_aoe%范围内造成%shard_damage%点伤害，并沉默%shard_duration%秒。", "en": "Releases a sonic boom when Queen of Pain blinks, at both her starting and ending locations. Deals %shard_damage% damage in a %shard_aoe% AoE and silences the target for %shard_duration% seconds."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["min_blink_range", "shard_damage", "shard_duration", "shard_aoe", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "shard"}, {"mechanism": "flying", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "projectile_dodge", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "self_mobility", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "self_mobility", "condition": "shard"}, {"mechanism": "silence", "condition": "shard"}]}, {"subject": "queenofpain_scream_of_pain", "name_zh": "痛苦女王·痛苦尖叫", "name_en": "Scream Of Pain", "description_zh": "痛苦女王发出刺耳的尖叫，对周围敌人造成伤害。造成伤害的%damage_reflected_to_self%%%会反弹回她身上。", "description_en": "The Queen of Pain lets loose a piercing scream around her, damaging nearby enemies.%damage_reflected_to_self%%% of the damage dealt to heroes is reflected back to her.", "notes_zh": ["痛苦尖叫能作用隐身单位。", "痛苦尖叫无法被躲避。", "对幻象造成的伤害不会反弹。反弹的伤害为减免前的，而且不致死。", "反弹伤害不提供任何吸血，而且无法反弹。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["area_of_effect", "projectile_speed", "damage", "damage_reflected_to_self", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "invisibility", "condition": "base"}]}]}
